{"parse": {"title": "Sergio de Larrea", "pageid": 17597828, "redirects": [], "text": {"*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<table class=\"infobox&#95;v2 infobox infobox--frwiki noarchive\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" class=\"entete basket-ball\" style=\"background-color:#DD8F56;color:#000000;\">Sergio de Larrea<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r226939240\">.mw-parser-output .entete.basket-ball{background-image:url(\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f4/Picto_Infobox_Basketball.png\")}</style>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fichier:Sergio_de_Larrea_5_Valencia_Basket_Euroleague_20260116_(2).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"Image illustrative de l\u2019article Sergio de Larrea\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/Sergio_de_Larrea_5_Valencia_Basket_Euroleague_20260116_%282%29.jpg/250px-Sergio_de_Larrea_5_Valencia_Basket_Euroleague_20260116_%282%29.jpg?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"220\" height=\"330\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/19/Sergio_de_Larrea_5_Valencia_Basket_Euroleague_20260116_%282%29.jpg/500px-Sergio_de_Larrea_5_Valencia_Basket_Euroleague_20260116_%282%29.jpg?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"5152\" data-file-height=\"7728\" /></a></span> <br />Sergio de Larrea en 2026.\n   </td></tr>\n   <tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\" style=\"padding:4px; text-align:center; background-color:#DD8F56; color:#000000\">Fiche d\u2019identit\u00e9</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">Nom complet\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Sergio de Larrea Asenjo\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n\n<th scope=\"row\">Nationalit\u00e9\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><span class=\"data